                           <span class=\"\">My Father's Shadow + live score</span>\n                        \n                    </h1>\n\n                    \n                    \n\n                    \n\n                    \n\n                    \n\n                    <div class=\"splash-header__footer\">\n                        <div>\n                            \n                                \n                                    <span class=\"splash-header__dates\">7 February 2026 at 19.00–21.00</span>\n                                \n                            \n\n                            \n\n\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"btn-group splash-header__action-buttons\">\n                            <div class=\"btn-row\">\n                                \n                                \n                                <a href=\"https://shop.tate.org.uk/membership\" class=\"btn btn--type__secondary btn--size__xl btn--shape__circle btn--style__text\">\n                                    <i class=\"btn__icon\"></i>\n                                    <span class=\"btn__text\">Become a Member</span>\n                                </a>\n                                \n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"splash-header__media\">\n                    <div class=\"splash-header__media--inner responsive-container\">\n                        \n                            \n\n\n    \n    <picture\n        >\n        <source srcset=\"\n            https://media.tate.org.uk/aztate-prd-ew-dg-wgtail-st1-ctr-data/images/my-fathers-shadow-01.width-420.jpg 420w,\n            https://media.tate.org.uk/aztate-prd-ew-dg-wgtail-st1-ctr-data/images/my-fathers-shadow-01.width-540.jpg 540w,\n            https://media.tate.org.uk/aztate-prd-ew-dg-wgtail-st1-ctr-data/images/my-fathers-shadow-01.width-840.jpg 840w,\n            https://media.tate.org.uk/aztate-prd-ew-dg-wgtail-st1-ctr-data/images/my-fathers-shadow-01.width-1200.jpg 1200w,\n            https://media.tate.org.uk/aztate-prd-ew-dg-wgtail-st1-ctr-data/images/my-fathers-shadow-01.width-1440.jpg 1280w,\n            \"\n        sizes=\"\n            (max-width: 479px) 420px,\n            (max-width: 600px) 540px,\n            (max-width: 1023px) 840px,\n            (max-width: 1440px) 1200px,\n            1440px,\n            \"\n        >\n        <img\n            alt=\"A father walks, holding twin sons by their hands\"\n            src=\"https://media.tate.org.uk/aztate-prd-ew-dg-wgtail-st1-ctr-data/images/my-fathers-shadow-01.width-420.jpg\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            width=\"420\"\n            height=\"236\"\n            \n            \n        >\n    </picture>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"splash-header__image-caption\">\n                    <p data-block-key=\"llp7g\">Still from <i>My Father's Shadow</i></p>\n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"content-main\">\n\n        <div class=\"container container--primary-content\">\n            <div class=\"container__inner\">\n                <div class=\"grid-outer\">\n                    <div class=\"grid-col--66\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"content__standfirst\"><p data-block-key=\"hsg45\">Join us for a special live–scored screening of <i>My Father’s Shadow</i></p></div>\n\n                        \n\n\n                        <div class=\"content__body-text\" itemprop=\"mainContentOfPage\">\n\n                            \n                            \n                                    \n<div class=\"event-outer\n    container\">\n    <div class=\"event-inner\n        container__inner\">\n        <div class=\"block-rich_text\"><p data-block-key=\"ym1s8\">Join us for a unique screening of<i> My Father’s Shadow</i>, the directorial debut from filmmaker Akinola Davies Jr.. The film will be brought to life with live music and sound, performed by the creators of the original film score, CJ Mirra and Duval Timothy, joined by special guests.</p><p data-block-key=\"a8r9r\">The semi-autobiographical film tells a story about family, memory and the relationships that shape us. It is set over the course of a single day in Nigeria during the 1993 election crisis. It follows a father, Fola, who estranged from his two young sons, Remi and Akin. They travel through Lagos while political unrest threatens their journey home.</p><p data-block-key=\"5hsa0\">Set in Tate Modern’s South Tank, the score will be performed live alongside the film. Expect a powerful shared experience between the audience, the performers and the screen.</p></div>\n<div class=\"block-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion__container\" data-accordion>\n    <div class=\"accordion\">\n        \n            \n<div class=\"accordion__item\">\n    <h2 id=\"accessibility\" class=\"accordion__header\">\n        <button\n            id=\"h.accessibility-6eNam\"\n            class=\"accordion__button\"\n            data-accordion-question\n            aria-controls=\"c.accessibility-6eNam\"\n            aria-expanded=\"false\">\n            \n            <span class=\"accordion__title\">\n                Accessibility\n            </span>\n        </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div\n        id=\"c.accessibility-6eNam\"\n        data-accordion-answer\n        class=\"accordion__content\"\n        aria-labelledby=\"h.accessibility-6eNam\">\n        <div class=\"block-rich_text\"><p data-block-key=\"xkwou\">The film duration is 93 minutes.</p><p data-block-key=\"anh9s\">The film will be accompanied by live music and sound, played by an ensemble in the centre of the space.</p><p data-block-key=\"228pf\">Ear defenders will be available for those who would like them.</p><p data-block-key=\"419gn\">Spaces will be reserved for wheelchair users and companions. Please let us know if you would like a space reserved for you.</p><p data-block-key=\"4mp7m\">You will be seated for the performance, either on chairs or cushions on the floor. Seats are hard, some of which have arms for additional support.</p><p data-block-key=\"apbo9\">The performance takes place in the South Tank, on Level 0 of the Blavatnik Building at Tate Modern.</p><p data-block-key=\"5sgsb\">Fully accessible toilets are located off of the Tanks foyer, adjacent to the South Tank.</p><p data-block-key=\"4jdm9\">All Tate Modern entrances are step-free. You can enter via the Turbine Hall and into the Natalie Bell Building on Holland Street, or into the Blavatnik Building on Sumner Street.</p><p data-block-key=\"ejmfp\">To help plan your visit to Tate Modern, have a look at our <a href=\"https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-modern/visual-story\">visual story</a>. It includes photographs and information about what you can expect from a visit to the gallery.</p><p data-block-key=\"6vbv5\"><a href=\"https://media.tate.org.uk/aztate-prd-ew-dg-wgtail-st1-ctr-data/galleries/TM_map.pdf\">Download Tate Modern map PDF</a></p><p data-block-key=\"dfjqc\">For more information before your visit:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\"8i5g0\">Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@tate.org.uk\">hello@tate.org.uk</a></li><li data-block-key=\"2c736\">Call +44 (0)20 7887 8888 (daily 10.00–17.00)</li></ul><p data-block-key=\"d3vka\"><a href=\"https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-modern#accessibility\">Check all Tate Modern accessibility information.</a></p></div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n                            \n\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid-col--33\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"content-block content-block--location venue-block\">\n\n                            \n                                <h2 class=\"content-block__title\">Tate Modern</h2>\n                                <div class=\"location\">\n                                    \n                                    <p data-block-key=\"utcqo\">South Tank</p>\n                                    <span class=\"location__row\">Bankside</span><br /><span class=\"location__row\">London SE1 9TG</span><br />\n                                    \n    \t                            <a href=\"https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-modern\" class=\"location__link text-link\">Plan your visit</a>\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            \n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"content-block content-block--dates\">\n\n                            <h2 class=\"content-block__title\">Date &amp; Time</h2>\n\n                                \n\n                                    \n                                        <p class=\"content-block--dates__item\">7 February 2026 at 19.00–21.00</p>\n                                    \n\n                                \n\n                            <p data-block-key=\"qnhxs\">This event has sold out</p>\n                        </div>\n                        \n\n                        \n\n                        \n\n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"block-heading\"><div class=\"event-outercontainer\">\n    <div class=\"event-innercontainer__inner\">\n        <h2 id=\"we-recommend\" class=\"section__title\">We recommend</h2>\n\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block-strip\">\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-strip container \">\n    <div